category: Libs
requires: libflint-devel libgmp-devel libmpfr-devel libmsolve4 pkg-config
sdesc: "Library for Polynomial System Solving through Algebraic Methods (development)"
ldesc: "msolve is an open source C library implementing computer algebra algorithms
